<p>Lee Atchison is a software architect, author, and technology thought
leader. He's spent his career building and scaling software systems, most
recently as a CTO working with engineering teams and executives on the
architecture decisions that actually move the needle &mdash; with roles at
Amazon.com, AWS, New Relic, and Blameless along the way.</p>

<p>Software Architecture Insights is where Lee shares what he's learning in
real time, from the systems he's working on right now &mdash; not from a textbook.
Every Tuesday morning, it's practical thinking on architecture, cloud scale,
and technical leadership from someone still doing the work.</p>

